---

<section class="section" id="lyrics">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Lyrics that keep time.</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Play music in Spotify or any app that publishes a Windows media session. HiyoDyna
        follows along with synchronized lyrics, in the expanded player and on the collapsed
        capsule.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="lyrics">
      <ul class="lyrics__facts">
        <li>
          <strong>Providers</strong>
          <span>AMLL TTML DB, LRCLIB, and NetEase. No account or API key required.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Timing</strong>
          <span>Word timing first, then line timing. Untimed text is ignored.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Find lyrics</strong>
          <span>Search by title and artist, then apply a recording in one click.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Control</strong>
          <span>Auto, Lines, or Words mode and a timing offset live in Settings.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Compact</strong>
          <span>The collapsed capsule shows the current line and previews the next one.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Cache</strong>
          <span>Bounded to 128 entries under <code>%LOCALAPPDATA%\HiyoDyna\lyrics</code>.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="lyrics__mock" aria-hidden="true">
        <p class="lyrics__mock-label">Illustration</p>
        <div class="lyrics__player">
          <div class="lyrics__player-head">
            <span class="lyrics__source">Spotify</span>
            <span class="lyrics__track">Night Train · Oscar Peterson</span>
          </div>
          <div class="lyrics__artwork"></div>
          <div class="lyrics__progress">
            <span>1:24</span>
            <div class="lyrics__bar"><span class="lyrics__bar-fill"></span></div>
            <span>3:41</span>
          </div>
          <div class="lyrics__controls">
            <span>‹‹</span><span>❚❚</span><span>››</span>
          </div>
          <div class="lyrics__lines">
            <p class="lyrics__line lyrics__line--muted">The wheels are turning</p>
            <p class="lyrics__line lyrics__line--active">And the night is burning</p>
            <p class="lyrics__line lyrics__line--muted">Through the city lights</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lyrics__capsule">
          <span class="lyrics__capsule-dot"></span>
          <span class="lyrics__capsule-text">And the night is burning</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .lyrics {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.05fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 80px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .lyrics__facts {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }

  .lyrics__facts li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: 12px clamp(16px, 3vw, 40px);
    padding-block: 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .lyrics__facts strong {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .lyrics__mock {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .lyrics__mock-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .lyrics__player {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 360px;
    padding: 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--surface);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .lyrics__player-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .lyrics__source {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .lyrics__track {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .lyrics__artwork {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, transparent), transparent 60%),
      #1a1c1d;
  }

  .lyrics__progress {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .lyrics__bar {
    flex: 1;
    height: 3px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 10%);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .lyrics__bar-fill {
    display: block;
    width: 36%;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .lyrics__controls {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 24px;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .lyrics__lines {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding-top: 6px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }

  .lyrics__line {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .lyrics__line--active {
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .lyrics__line--muted {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .lyrics__capsule {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--capsule-top);
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .lyrics__capsule-dot {
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, transparent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .lyrics__capsule-text {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text);
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .lyrics {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .lyrics__facts li {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 4px;
    }
  }
</style>